    {
      "source": "Query the members of a geo set which are within the borders of the area specified by a given <a href=\"../domain/geo/GeoShape.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.domain.geo\"><code>shape</code></a>\nand store the result at <code>destKey</code>. The query's center point is provided by <a href=\"../domain/geo/GeoReference.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.domain.geo\"><code>GeoReference</code></a>.",
      "translation": "查询地理集合中位于由给定<a href=\"../domain/geo/GeoShape.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.domain.geo\"><code>shape</code></a>指定的区域边界内的成员，并将结果存储到<code>destKey</code>。查询的中心点由<a href=\"../domain/geo/GeoReference.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.domain.geo\"><code>GeoReference</code></a>提供。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the members of a geo set which are within the borders of the area specified by a given <a href=\"../domain/geo/GeoShape.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.domain.geo\"><code>shape</code></a>. The query's center point is provided by <a href=\"../domain/geo/GeoReference.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.domain.geo\"><code>GeoReference</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回地理集合中位于由给定<a href=\"../domain/geo/GeoShape.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.domain.geo\"><code>shape</code></a>指定的区域边界内的成员。查询的中心点由<a href=\"../domain/geo/GeoReference.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.domain.geo\"><code>GeoReference</code></a>提供。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
